        <mxCell id="note" value="Notes&#10;• trace_id is generated PHP-side and echoed everywhere → click-to-source can resolve overlays after navigation.&#10;• If extraction fails (schema-invalid / low-confidence), the supervisor returns a safe-refusal — no DB writes.&#10;• Each step emits an OTel span; PHI redactor strips raw text before export.&#10;• PDF bytes are written once and referenced by path; nothing copies the binary into the trace." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
